(7620667, 1233878, 96751, '<td valign="top">I find the attempt at her blur the more interesting and challenging. When I look at her work, though, I see the empty, focused place where there might have been a subject in focus, and they stepped out of frame. The blur itself was no the subject.</td>', 'I find the attempt at her blur the more interesting and challenging. When I look at her work, though, I see the empty, focused place where there might have been a subject in focus, and they stepped out of frame. The blur itself was no the subject.', '2019-03-19 17:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
