(7620934, 1234440, 114285, '<td valign="top">I love your title and I love this photo.  The very first time I looked at it I was in love, truly simplicity at its best.  However Im not  sure its really her style, I mean the minimalism is, but not the black-and-white high contrast look...but hey I really think its the best shot here. My top pick, and a fave.<br/> <br/>Edited for typos.</td>', 'I love your title and I love this photo.  The very first time I looked at it I was in love, truly simplicity at its best.  However Im not  sure its really her style, I mean the minimalism is, but not the black-and-white high contrast look...but hey I really think its the best shot here. My top pick, and a fave. Edited for typos.', '2019-03-20 22:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
