(7621977, 1234439, 124815, '<td valign="top">It was only 7 for me before I could comment or bump. <br/>I admire a lot the composition, the position of the woman, her big head, the fact that she looks at something outside the picture, her musing about a world that she seems removed from and that remains verdant and vibrant</td>', 'It was only 7 for me before I could comment or bump. I admire a lot the composition, the position of the woman, her big head, the fact that she looks at something outside the picture, her musing about a world that she seems removed from and that remains verdant and vibrant', '2019-03-25 23:02:55.000000', NULL, 0),
