(7621980, 1234426, 124815, '<td valign="top">Not had time to comment but I am captivated by the sky on which what looks like wisteria silhouettes bring peace to the night</td>', 'Not had time to comment but I am captivated by the sky on which what looks like wisteria silhouettes bring peace to the night', '2019-03-25 23:08:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(7622005, 1234488, 87808, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=124815" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">mariuca</a>, thank you for the comment.  It didn''t start out like this, it was just my front room curtains, but the second I hit contrast, this woman appeared.  And once it did, it didn''t go away. It is one of those things, that when you see you , you can not unsee it. I tested it out on several people. 2 out of 3 saw it right away, the other had to have detailed instructions on where it was and then he saw a naked male instead. I like that you think cracked mirror of metal, I almost feel like it is one of those bright white tree gatherings with flaky bark.  Weird how we perceive things. I have actually printed it out and it is on my bookcase.</td>', ' mariuca, thank you for the comment.  It didn''t start out like this, it was just my front room curtains, but the second I hit contrast, this woman appeared.  And once it did, it didn''t go away. It is one of those things, that when you see you , you can not unsee it. I tested it out on several people. 2 out of 3 saw it right away, the other had to have detailed instructions on where it was and then he saw a naked male instead. I like that you think cracked mirror of metal, I almost feel like it is one of those bright white tree gatherings with flaky bark.  Weird how we perceive things. I have actually printed it out and it is on my bookcase.', '2019-03-26 09:26:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(7622641, 1234428, 66384, '<td valign="top">Awesome! Congratulations John.</td>', 'Awesome! Congratulations John.', '2019-03-30 14:10:39.000000', NULL, 0);
